87403 1113 #uuid "2f1bb893-693a-5e47-8b85-ca41d1ece733" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287403 1145 "The formula for the derivative of $arcsec$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsecx)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2arcsec(6x-1)) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsec(6x-1)) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{(6x-1)^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x-1) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{{(6x-1)}^{2}-1}}\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{36{x}^{2}-12x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{4(9{x}^{2}-3x)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}-3x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287405 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287406 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287407 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287408 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287409 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1041 "selection" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1104 #edb/ref 17592186287407 13194139534420 true] [17592186287404 1110 #uuid "8280f4aa-5a6e-5b72-bfd5-c3e14aa0e872" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287405 1034 "\\frac{6}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}-x}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287405 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287405 1111 #uuid "53c1ee49-f35d-5bf0-bba5-8335655096f2" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287406 1034 "-\\frac{1}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}-x}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287406 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287406 1111 #uuid "3052b77d-8f58-5636-ba3e-4658c108161b" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287407 1034 "\\frac{6}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}-3x}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287407 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287407 1111 #uuid "5e5ae948-cc82-5eea-a36d-9abfb87984b7" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287408 1034 "-\\frac{6}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}-3x}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287408 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287408 1111 #uuid "900a49b1-f31b-5c34-84c3-214bc320817b" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287409 1034 "\\frac{1}{|6x-1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}-3x}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287409 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287409 1111 #uuid "84dee1da-37c9-51eb-9b31-4b8489a125fb" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1017 #edb/ref 17592186287411 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1089 "q-341145" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1100 "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}\\cdot arccot\\,(\\sqrt{x}).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{arccot(\\sqrt{x})}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1113 #uuid "1154e30f-a8e4-5c95-bbfc-9a667bc384d6" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287410 1145 "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}\\cdot arccot(\\sqrt{x})) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x})\\cdot arccot(\\sqrt{x})+\\sqrt{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,(\\sqrt{x})) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\cdot arccot(\\sqrt{x})+\\sqrt{x}\\cdot [-\\frac{1}{1+{(\\sqrt{x})}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x})] \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot(\\sqrt{x})}{2\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{1+x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot(\\sqrt{x})}{2\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{1}{2(1+x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287411 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287412 13194139534420 true] [17592186287411 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534420 true] [17592186287411 1041 "field-1" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287411 1104 #edb/ref 17592186287412 13194139534420 true] [17592186287411 1110 #uuid "41f086b9-fc8f-52d6-a5f1-74a709c3e4b8" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287412 1034 "\\frac{1}{2(1+x)}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287412 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287412 1111 #uuid "cc6af7be-a986-51ee-9979-716f4eb97648" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1017 #edb/ref 17592186287414 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1089 "q-341147" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1100 "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot arccot\\,x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{arccot\\,x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1113 #uuid "8f4fa426-0741-5f44-8bf7-92d3d10ecf3e" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287413 1145 "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{4}⁡x)\\cdot arccot\\,x+{log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\cdot arccot\\,x+{log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot\\,x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡x}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287415 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287416 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1041 "field-1" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1104 #edb/ref 17592186287416 13194139534420 true] [17592186287414 1110 #uuid "bddca692-11f6-562f-a893-36412ab654e7" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287415 1034 "\\frac{1}{1+x^2}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287415 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287415 1111 #uuid "118b8f38-c091-5f5e-a66f-6a5d183aa2c2" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287416 1034 "\\frac{\\ln(x)}{\\ln(4)(1+x^2)}" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287416 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534420 true] [17592186287416 1111 #uuid "39242b3b-5cb2-5193-a68e-4ceb81dcfc50" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1017 #edb/ref 17592186287418 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1017 #edb/ref 17592186287420 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1089 "q-341179" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1100 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{arccsc\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.$" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1113 #uuid "d2d893fd-7701-5397-af73-678ba255c33f" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287417 1145 "Here, we let $u(x)={3}^{x}$ and $v(x)=arccsc\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\cdot arccsc\\,x-{3}^{x}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}. \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{arccsc\\,x}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287418 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287419 13194139534420 true] [17592186287418 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534420 true] [17592186287418 1041 "field-1" 13194139534420 true] [17592186287418 1104 #edb/ref 17592186287419 13194139534420 true] [17592186287418 1110 #uuid "35bb1cf0-2494-5df1-9da3-309b535962be" 1319